-- Sean, 2026-11-12: "Fix the dashboard boxes the same way". Nothing scrolls inside itself; short lists show five, then Show N more.
update knowledge_records set body = body || jsonb_build_object('no_inner_scroll', jsonb_build_object('date','2026-11-12','quote','Fix the dashboard boxes the same way','rule','Nothing scrolls inside itself (the trackpad gets stuck over self-scrolling boxes). Short lists show five, then Show N more opens the rest in place. Popups, dropdown results and modals may scroll within themselves. Replaces "short lists cap and scroll inside the box".')), updated_at = now() where slug = 'canon-sean-interface-defaults';
